window.products.push({"id":265016,"name":"Diamond Select Toys Marvel Galactus Sculpted Metal Bottle Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710hxBlMUzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer A Diamond Select release. When we get thirsty, we pop open a bottle cap, but when the Devourer of Worlds gets thirsty, he pops a polar ice cap. The Art Asylum designers have taken the iconic head of the world-eating Galactus and turned it into a solid metal bottle opener. Measuring 4 Inch tall with fridge-mountable magnets on the back, this item is a must-have for Fantastic Four fans and thirsty Marvelites everywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710hxBlMUzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIAMOND SELECT TOYS","source_asin":"B00BIR06LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BIR06LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BIR06LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265017,"name":"TreeWool Bathroom Rugs (21x34 & 17x24 Inch) Striped with Loop 2-Piece Mat Set, Extra Soft Super Absorbent Machine Washable Cotton Bath Mats with Latex","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eZwGdeK4L._AC_SL1417_.jpg","description":"Brand : TreeWool BOX CONTAINS : 2 Bathroom Rugs (One each in sizes 21\"x34\" and 17\"x24\"). These bath rugs are carefully hand finished and hand tufted to give you a superior quality product that would be a great addition to your bathroom. PRODUCT FEATURES : 1. These bath mats are made of high quality 100% cotton and are a thick 2000 GSM (Grams per Square Meter), offering superb absorbency 2. Indulge in luxury with these bathroom mats that offer comfort for your feet with excellent water absorbency 3. These bath rugs have latex sprayed to the back which make them anti skid or non-slip, to prevent them slipping under your feet, while being used on smooth floors 4. Use these mats anywhere at home including kitchen, bedroom, shower room, conservatory, etc. 5. Fully machine washable in cold setting. Use only mild detergents. Tumble dry in low heat. 6. Dry flat and fluff after drying GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU BUY 1. Due to differences in color saturation settings between each Computer, Laptop, Tablet or Phone the actual product might have a minor color difference to the picture on screen. 2. It is normal for some linting in new bathroom rugs. Linting will stop in couple of washes. 3. Always place the rug on dry floors only. Water under rugs may cause it slip. 4. Wash before use. This will ensure starch and loose fibers are removed, vibrancy of the color is retained and water absorption is good. 5. Use a little White Vinegar while washing, to enhance the vibrancy of the color. ABOUT TREEWOOL : At TreeWool, we are passionate about providing premium quality products at affordable price for every household. As much as we care about the quality of our products, we are also equally passionate about providing all our customers a great buying experience. We bring our expertise in Home Fashion sector in Europe to the US.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eZwGdeK4L._AC_SL1417_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeWool","source_asin":"B0746JLGJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746JLGJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746JLGJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
