window.products.push({"id":265025,"name":"LINSY HOME Convertible Sectional Couch, 3 Seat L Shaped Sofa with 2 USB Ports and Storage Bags, Small Sectional Sofa Set for Living Room, Apartment, D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8184-0cCvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Comfort with Ergonomic Design】 - Ergonomic design is at the heart of this sofa, with a 103° ideal angle for the back, 3-stage support design for waist, back, and head, 19'' seat depth and cushions formulated with 28d high-density foam to ensure lasting comfort and maximum relaxation 【2 Removable Headrests】 - Unlike other couch, with low and thin back cushions, this Linsy Home Sofa provide two additional removable headrests. These can be removed or their position adjusted in just a few seconds to better support neck and head, perfect for those who are sitting on sofas for a long time when watching movies 【Sleepable Armrest Pillows】 - We know everyone likes to lie down on the sectional sofa for living room from time to time, and we considered this in our design. We provide two soft and removable armrest cushions, perfect for you to lie down and take a nap 【USB Ports and Storage Function】 - Like everything we have done, our convertible L shaped sofa has convenient features you will love, starting with the two built-in USB ports, so there is no need to worry about your phone running out of power while playing phone games or live streaming on your sofa. We've included storage bags on both armrests for a handy place to stash devices and remotes 【Strict Material Selection for Durability】 - Each part of our living room couch has been tested repeatedly, from the P2 grade wooden frame to the thick hardware. It will stand the test of time and is very durable. The 100% polyester fabric has passed the CA65 certification, which is environmentally friendly and safe on the skin 【Movable Ottoman and Washable Cushions】 - The moveable chaise can be attached to any seat, left, right, or in the middle. You can place the ottoman according to your preference and space. The seat and back cushion covers are removable for washing with zippers on the back 【About the Package】 - The maximum seating capacity for the small sofa is 820lbs. The sofa set comes in 2 boxes, which may be delivered at different times. If you have any questions about the 2nd tracking number or the product, please get in touch with us. We will respond to you in 24 hours and solve any problem you may have. We aim to achieve 100% customer satisfaction 【Please Note】 - The back cushions of the l shaped couches are thick but are shipped vacuum packed. After unpacking, remove the cushions packaging and wait for at least 72 hours to let them regain their plush and comfortable status","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8184-0cCvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY HOME","source_asin":"B0BKLHXRLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKLHXRLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKLHXRLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
