window.products.push({"id":265080,"name":"Nylon Cooking Utensils, Spatula, and Soup Spoon With Handle Hole Stainless Steel Portable for Nonstick Cookware Kitchen Tools Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gQAHMb2jL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"If you are tired of scratching your pans with all-metal but hated the all-plastic that would heat up and not hold any weight. These cooking utensils fixed both issues, made of high-quality nylon material which is strong enough to stir hot foods but won’t scratch your pots. The stainless steel heads are all well attached to every handle. You don’t have to worry about where the utensil heads met the handles would be flimsy. So Get rid of your old mismatched utensils and try these out, you’ll love it! The simple yet modern design of our utensil set fits perfectly in any kitchen and easily matches the style of any other items or appliances. these are BPA free. Dishwasher safety. Packing list:1pc spatula + 1pc soup spoon","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gQAHMb2jL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tellshun","source_asin":"B081VNRZTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081VNRZTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081VNRZTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265081,"name":"臻三环 ZhenSanHuan HandHammered Iron Wok Flat Bottom Induction Suitable (32cm WoodHandle with Help)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":248.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yFMJxT8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our woks and pans were chosen and filmed by A Bite of China. It helps us getting more attention but also more and more low-quality counterfeits flooding the market. Every wok has been through 12 processes, 36,000 times of hand-hammering. You can see all the hammer prints but hardly feel them. The hammered surface absorb less oil than ordinary woks. It is nonstick because iron is reactive and will form a protective layer of iron oxide during use. It's color will change during use when forming the protection layer until it becomes black. It is an iron wok that can be passed on for generations. It has nothing but iron. It has been seasoned and you only need to wash it when you receive it. Iron gets rusted in water, so please dry it after use. Wipe a layer of oil over the cooking surface if you do not want to use it for a while.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yFMJxT8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"臻三环","source_asin":"B0836KFWJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0836KFWJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0836KFWJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
