window.products.push({"id":265119,"name":"Sensory Decisions Bread Smell - Bread Fragrance Fragrance Room Spray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zup3zH+TL._AC_SL1391_.jpg","description":"OVERVIEW Freshly baked bread room spray: the smell of baked bread in an atomiser spray! This product is a concentrated bread fragrance that has a multitude of uses in the home, business premises or at events. INSTRUCTIONS FOR USE: Indoor use: spray a few pumps into the centre of the room with the bottle upright. Avoid contact with polished surfaces, fabrics and soft furnishings before testing on an inconspicuous area first. Automotive application: After emptying, cleaning and vacuuming your car, spray the carpets, footwell mats and boot-liner liberally. If necessary, also sparingly spray head liners and seat covers. Replace mats and preferably leave for a few hours (or overnight). For intensive results, also spray sparingly down the air vents and leave to dry. PRECAUTIONS: Always test in an inconspicuous area before spraying direct onto materials or surfaces. Not suitable for eating, cooking or use as a flavouring. Not for application to the body. Always follow instructions. BOTTLE SIZE AND HOW LONG IT LASTS: Each bottle contains 50ml of long-lasting fragrance. The non-aerosol atomiser releases 0.14ml per actuation. There are nearly 360 actuations per bottle and typically only 2 - 3 are required per use. ABOUT THIS PRODUCT RANGE: This product is part of the \"Culinary Collection\" from Sensory Decisions, featuring a range of food-based singular scents and fragrance blends. The Culinary Collection also includes Fresh Bread, Coffee, Bubblegum, Popcorn, Bacon, Cinnamon and many others. Other collections from Sensory Decisions include: the Automotive Collection (New Car Smell, Leather, His & Hers), Nature & Outdoors Collection (Freshly Cut Grass, Sandalwood, Frangipani and more) Home & Indoors Collection (including Baby Powder, festive fragrances, Fresh Linen and many more) and the Clothing Collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zup3zH+TL._AC_SL1391_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sensory Decisions","source_asin":"B00CCO3L6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CCO3L6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CCO3L6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
