window.products.push({"id":265326,"name":"2 in one foil dispenser - Plastic Wrap Organizer, Foil Organizer for Drawer, 3.8\" tall spacious foil storage organizer for 12\" plastic wrap, wax paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818ZNlEan3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ COMPATIBLE WITH MAJOR BRANDS ] - This kitchen foil and wrap organizer is compatible with major brands like Kirkland, Reynolds, Glad, Saran, Solimo and others. It is designed for plastic wrap, aluminium foil, wax paper and parchment paper. [ SUPPORT MORE BRANDS WITH SUFFICIENT SPACE ] - This 2-in-1 foil and plastic wrap organizer is compatible with a 12-inch roll. Many 12-inch rolls are actually longer than 12 inches, so you will need sufficient space to fit this type of roll, this organizer's length is 13.8 inches, it surely fits. Overall dimension is 13.8 x 5.9 x 3.8 in ( including blade ). Please measure your drawer height before purchase [ ARCH-SHAPED OPENING DESIGN FOR HASSLE-FREE ACCESS ] - A bigger opening surely makes a lot of difference when you pull out the paper! Don't spend time and effort pulling out the paper from an organizer with a small opening, it is frustrating. We design our product by observing how you would use it, and this design suits you the best, life is tough, we made it easier! [ PREMIUM QUALITY AND DURABLE ] - This aluminum foil holder with cutter is made of premium bamboo, with excellent craftsmanship, and no sharp edge, it comes with a durable hidden cutter that cuts very smoothly and safely. What exactly is quality bamboo? The surface is treated, the structure is strengthened and it means less crack! The sliding door is convenient and it has 2 small magnets at the side for keeping the door closed. [ BIGGER INTERNAL SPACE ] - If you have thin roll and thick roll , you want to keep them all organized in one place. This foil and wrap dispenser has a bigger internal space, 2.56\" x 2.56\", so you can place them all in this organizer, it fits up to 300 FT plastic wrap, 250FT tin foil and 200 FT parchment paper. Even if you don't have any thick roll now, you can still buy this, as you might buy a thick roll in future. [ LOVE EVERYTHING NEAT AND LABELED? ] - We know you like things to be neat, and it is a must to be able to identify what type of paper is in which slot, at a glance. Don't worry, this bamboo aluminum foil dispenser with cutter comes with 16 labels, you can label 4 types of roll, \"Wax\", \"Plastic\", \"Foil\", and \"Parchment\". Furthermore, If you feel frustrated finding roll start, simply stick the roll-start label at the edge of the roll to the side, saves the hassle. [VERSATILE BAMBOO FOIL AND PLASTIC WRAP ORGANIZER] - This cling wrap dispenser with cutter can be used in different place, it can be wall-mounted, and placed in the drawer or tabletop. It comes with 3 holes at the back so you can secure it against the wall [ QUALITY PRODUCT AND SERVICE ] - NEATCHIC is committed to providing best quality products and services. We're very happy to help if you have any concern.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818ZNlEan3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEATCHIC","source_asin":"B0B242KJRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B242KJRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B242KJRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
