window.products.push({"id":265329,"name":"Martha Stewart Miles Modern Diamond Anti-Fatigue Air-Infused Kitchen Mat, Beige, 19.6\"x39\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91E3UZWBbzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy comfort in each step with the Martha Stewart Miles Air Mat. This kitchen mat features a classic trellis design that will add style to your décor. Machine made of polyester, this kitchen mat is ideal for wherever you may often stand for relief while you work, cook or clean. Enhanced with a slip resistant backing for a safe and secured step on any flat surface. This mat offers versatile use and can be used in the kitchen, bathroom, laundry room or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91E3UZWBbzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTHA STEWART","source_asin":"B0C5MJBC81","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5MJBC81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5MJBC81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265330,"name":"Umbra Cappa Curtain Rod, Includes 2 Matching Finials, Brackets & Hardware, 36 to 66-Inches, Brass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WJdCXsFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Windows are an essential part of your home and provide a unique opportunity to dramatically improve the aesthetic of each room simply by adding attractive curtains or drapes. But to get it just right you need a curtain rod that works in harmony with your chosen curtains or drapes to enhance the room décor, not overpower it.Introducing Cappa Curtain Rod by UmbraWith a modern yet understated design, the Cappa curtain rod is a perfect way to complement your curtains or drapes without drawing attention away from them. The clean, minimalistic styling and attractive modern finish is a decorator’s dream come true because Cappa works with a wide variety of decorative styles and color palettes.Sturdy, Adjustable & StylishWhen it comes to curtain rods, quality construction is important and Cappa doesn’t disappoint. Unlike cheaply made rods that tend to bend or warp over time, each Cappa curtain rod from Umbra is made of high-quality metal and individually checked for quality assurance. The result is a super-sturdy rod that will support a variety of window fashions, including light to medium-weight curtains, up to a max weight of 22lbs.Your Cappa curtain rod conveniently adjusts and gives you the flexibility to accommodate 1 or 2 curtain panel configurations. Plus, everything you need to get it set up fast comes in the box, including 2 matching metal finials, 3 adjustable wall-mounted curtain rod brackets, screws, drywall anchors and easy-to-follow installation instructions.Instantly Upgrade Your Home Décor with the Cappa Curtain Rod by Umbra.About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual, and functional design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WJdCXsFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B0BH1L3JN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH1L3JN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH1L3JN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265331,"name":"SKL Home Aviary Cafe Curtain Tier Pair, 54 Inches x 36 Inches, Pastels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TMY2CjfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome the nature into your decorating with the beautiful Aviary Window Curtains. These light-filtering rod pockets are printed with watercolor-look branches where little birds nestle among the leaves and buds. Adding interest to the design is the cream, textured, slub-weave fabric made of soft and durable polyester. The easy-care, machine wash and dry Aviary rod pocket will accommodate rods up to 3/4 inch in diameter. SKL Home by Saturday Knight Ltd. brings personality, fun, and flair to the most intimate spaces in your home, with products ranging from bath accessories and shower curtains to towels, curtains, and beyond. Whether your style is upbeat and modern or classic and cozy, SKL Home provides a look to complement almost any décor. Combining 40+ years' experience, global design inspiration, and premium fabrications, SKL Home continues to lead the way in home accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TMY2CjfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKL Home","source_asin":"B09FQ54TQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FQ54TQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FQ54TQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
