window.products.push({"id":265336,"name":"Momscook 1.5-Quart Saucepan Stainless Steel Multi-Layer Saucepan with Glass Lid, Strainer Lid Cookware，Bakelite Handle with Wooden Soft Touch - Dishwa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i1flJJstL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Your Life with Momscook Saucepan Heating milk with the help of this complete Momscook Classic Stainless Steel 1.5-Quart saucepan.  Made with high quality 18/10 food-grade stainless steel, which is highly durable, resistant to rust, stain, corrosion or crack, safe and healthy, easy to clean. Triple-Ply construction heats quickly and spreads heat evenly, slow heating but good insulation performance, lasting. Glass cover with straining holes on both sides to strain pasta, noodles, vegetables and many more. Pour spouts on both sides of the rim for right and left handed. There is scale in saucepan for easy cooking sauce. Compatible with all cooktops, including induction cooker. The saucepan is dishwasher safe for easy cleaning, you can use the saucepan safely in the oven or broiler. Oven-safe to 500 degrees F. Professional Quality - Made of fine quality stainless steel, with decent gauge for strength and durability, safe and healthy, easy to clean.  - Tri-Ply construction heats quickly and spreads heat evenly, slow heating but good insulation performance, lasting. - Bakelite handle with wooden soft touch, it delivers low thermal conductivity, relaxed cooking and cool handles offers a comfortable grip for any chef, frying and saute. - Glass cover with straining holes on both sides to strain pasta, noodles, vegetables and many more. Pour spouts on both sides of the rim for right and left handed. - There is scale in saucepan for easy cooking sauce. - Oven safe up to 500 Fahrenheit, the pots and pans are suitable for all stovetops, including induction cooker.  - Saucepan is dishwasher safe for easy cleaning, you can use it safely in the oven or broiler. - Including lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i1flJJstL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Momscook","source_asin":"B07LFYBW25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LFYBW25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LFYBW25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265337,"name":"Staub Cast Iron 1.5-qt Petite French Oven - Matte White, Made in France","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mSDw-MXIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Staub's 1. 5 quart Cast Iron Petite French Oven boasts the benefits of a full-size cocotte in a compact size. Get fluffy rice, tender grains and creamy oatmeal thanks to Staub's signature new lid. Staub's latest innovation, the Chistera drop-structure lid, has solved the challenge of curved lids - they limit moisture to sides - by ensuring continuous condensation throughout. Unlike countertop rice cookers, Staub's Petite French Oven can be transported from the stovetop to the table. No need for serving bowls; these charming cocottes take care of both cooking and plating. Rice has never been so easy to make.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mSDw-MXIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAUB","source_asin":"B07P2WFTMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P2WFTMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P2WFTMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
