window.products.push({"id":265408,"name":"TAKETWOPILLOWS AND CALL ME IN THE MORNING! (Take Two Pillows) One Neck/Back Bolster Support Pillow Buckwheat Hulls Lavender Scented, Adjustable Fill. ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t+dKHfthL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This decorative, unique and functional 16 inch neck or back pillow is made from Indonesian Batik with a hand painted and stamped dragonfly pattern of yellows, blues, greens and orange. Filled with buckwheat hulls and 1 cup of lavender buds, it weighs just under 2 pounds and measures 16 inches long by 6 inches high and 4 inches deep. This hand-made high quality support pillow may slightly vary in size. Unlike other pillow fillings, buckwheat hulls do not compress under pressure. Over time the hulls will break down for a softer feel which is why we ship them quite firm and full. To reinvigorate the pillow's scent, pinch or knead the pillow. You may feel the lavender buds open and release fresh scent. These one-of-a-kind Batiks are produced on the island of Java in Indonesia by skilled dye masters. Each yard of these sumptuous fabrics is unique. The fabric is hand-stamped and then hand-painted multiple times, with many different pairs of hands working on every yard. Most of the work is done outside, so the weather greatly influences the results. Due to this specialized hand-process, there may be some inconsistencies to color and pattern, while maintaining subtle color variations that are so important to this traditional technique. Spine and lumbar support. Some of the main features of this small but effective pillow are that it’s great to hug on your belly for comfort, not too heavy. A wonderful little neck stretcher while you’re lying down and a terrific addition to your regular pillow if you are a side or belly sleeper. As well as it’s main purpose of neck pillow or lumbar support. As always simple packaging for a small carbon footprint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t+dKHfthL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAKETWOPILLOWS AND CALL ME IN THE MORNING!","source_asin":"B007OSW8Q0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007OSW8Q0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007OSW8Q0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
