window.products.push({"id":265438,"name":"Baby Nest Designs Elephant Baby Shower Decorations for Girl Pink Baby Shower Backdrop With Balloons, Its a Girl Banner, Paper Hanging Decorations and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qYyhrSPLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It’s Not What You Were Expecting... It’s Elephant-tially BETTER! Forget about sparse baby elephant baby shower decorations, and don’t worry about shopping around to find all those cute matching elephanty things, because we’ve already found the pink party decorations, and packaged it up into a professional little kit for your baby shower! You see, Baby Nest Designs is the original creator of the thick, black gender reveal balloons - and with over 10,000 reveals under our belt, not to mention countless kids themed birthday parties and we’ll make sure your baby shower decor is perfect too! Here’s What’s In Your 50 Piece Pink Backdrop Set (10) Pink Latex Balloons with Elephant Print (12”) (10) Grey Latex Balloons with Elephant Print (12”) (10) White Latex Balloons (12”) (4) Clear Balloons with Gold Confetti (4) Paper Lantern Decorations (4) White, Gold and Pink Paper Pom Poms Decorations (1) 6 Foot It’s a Girl Banner (Pink and Gold) (6) Cardboard Swirl Decorations (1) Cute 6 Foot Elephant Party Garland - (Pink and Grey) ... But Let’s Address One Final Thing - Quality. The biggest worry about buying decorations online is the quality. And while we can’t say you won’t find that one in a million balloon that had a bad day, we can promise we only use premium manufacturers and fast customer service. In fact, we use 3.5g balloons where most others use only 2.5g. Your set will come carefully packaged of course, and when it arrives, check it and tell us if anything is missing so we can replace it fast before your party. Love celebrating the soon-to-be birth of a very special little girl, amongst the sweetest elephant decorations... or we’ll refund every cent. Make your Baby Shower a work of art, with Baby Nest Designs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qYyhrSPLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baby Nest Designs","source_asin":"B07WFHXTWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFHXTWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFHXTWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
