window.products.push({"id":265460,"name":"Butter Crock for Counter, DAYYET French Butter Dish, Ceramic Butter Keeper Crock with Water Line, Perfect Spreadable Consistency, Large Capacity for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QrjcmLvAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say Goodbye to Cold & Hard Butter: This butter crock keeps butter soft and ready to spread on toast, biscuits, waffles, pancakes and more without having mess on your table. The classic butter keeper crock with water keeps butter fresh and spreadable at room temperature. No more cold and hard butter from the fridge! Large Capacity & Easy to Use: Simply pour cold water to the waterline of the crock for an airtight seal that prevents spoilage, pack butter firmly to avoid air bubbles and prevent butter from falling into the water. With large capacity, it easily fits 1 and 1/2 sticks of any kinds butter for a big family. Super Cute Country Design: Designed with vintage mason look style, this french butter dish will surely add a country charm to any modern rustic kitchen decor or table decor. The butter crock for counter is also a ideal gift choice for housewarmings, weddings, Thanksgiving and Christmas holidays. Safe and Durable Ceramic: This french butter crock is made of high-quality ceramic that's lead-free, chip-resistant, and more sturdy than stoneware and plastic. Dishwasher and freezer Safe. Warm Tips: Please keep the lid clean and dry before using. Over-softened butter is the most common cause for butter falling into the water. Refresh your cold bottled or filtered water each day if possible or every 2-3 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QrjcmLvAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAYYET","source_asin":"B09KLC2QV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KLC2QV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KLC2QV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
