window.products.push({"id":265473,"name":"Gifts for Mom CULPAN 3D Crystal Photo, Custom Crystal with Engraved Photo & Personalized Message, Personalized Gifts for Women Mothers Day, Fathers Da","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nV83T581L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAN BE PRESERVED FOR 1000 YEARS - Whoever you are, there is a moment in your life when that you want to remember it forever. Photos fade and the data disappears, yet CULPAN 3D crystal photos can be preserved for at least 1,000 years. Either you want to commemorate the day you and your loved one first met or remember those love ones who have gone to heaven, CULPAN 3D crystal photos are the best choice for you, this will be the most special and coolest gift for Mothers Day 2022. CAREFULLY SELECTED MATERIALS - Not every K9 crystal can be preserved for 1000 years. We use Austrian jewelry grade high density and high purity K9 crystal. It has the highest light transmittance and is three times harder than ordinary K9 crystal. We only use high quality crystals without dust or defects inside. Therefore your 3D crystal photos will have impressive clarity and will stand out in Any space. FLEXIBLE PERSONALIZATION - We will convert your 2D photo into a 3D model for you free of charge and engrave it inside the crystal by photo-etching technology. 3D engraving will create a mesmerizing following effect, which needs you to experience its wonders by yourself. it is highly recommended to upgrade your 3D crystal photo with a bright LED light stand in order to add extra charm to your personalized crystal photo. ADVANCED ENGRAVING TECHNOLOGY - We have been established in the USA for 10 years, in addition, we are equiped with well-rained designers and the most advanced aerospace grade photoetching machine from Netherlands. You will be amazed by the clarity of your CULPAN 3D crystal photos. If you are looking for a customized gift for your family and friends, then this 3D crystal photo is the perfect gift choice to capture happy moments, work achievements, graduations or other special occasions. LIFETIME WARRANTY - When we receive your order, we go through the 8 process : layout-modeling-transmittance test-photo-etch engraving-micro distance test-inspection-packagin. Whether you are an individual or a company we will treat your order with the utmost care. We promise to ship within 2-3 days. Trust us, it is worth the wait! You/your loved ones will receive the best gift of a lifetime. Every CULPAN's work is covered by a lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nV83T581L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CULPAN","source_asin":"B0BRJ59R9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRJ59R9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRJ59R9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
