window.products.push({"id":265567,"name":"Ashley Furniture Signature Design - Malchin Casual Upholstered Loveseat with Faux Crystal Button Tufting - RTA Sofa in a Box - Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uMX1II7tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CHESTERFIELD LOVESEAT: Feeling star struck yet? We are with this timeless Chesterfield sofa design. Chic detailing such as the rolled arms and diamond tufting provide that luxe finish you crave STYLISH COMFORT: High-resiliency foam cushions are wrapped in supple polyester with faux crystal button tufting. Designed with black nickel nailhead trim and exposed feet in a faux wood finish BOLD RED: Fashionistas rejoice—elevated style is brought to the forefront with this vibrant shade of red in your living room PERFECT CHAIR COMPANION: Measuring 84\" W x 33.5\" D x 29.25\" H, this couch sets nicely with an accent chair or coffee table. Add throw pillows for extra comfort, and you're set MODULAR ASSEMBLY: Loveseat ships in a single box with easy-to-follow instructions to assemble DIRECT FROM THE MANUFACTURER: Ashley Furniture goes the extra mile to package, protect and deliver your purchase in a timely manner BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: Designed and manufactured by Ashley Furniture Industries. The trusted source for stylish furniture, lighting, rugs, accessories and mattresses. For every taste and budget","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uMX1II7tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Design by Ashley","source_asin":"B07CLN44JP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CLN44JP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CLN44JP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265568,"name":"YR 10\" Multi-function Kitchen Collapsible Cutting Chopping Board with Colander and Tub with Drain Plug - Lightweight Washing/Storage Tub for Fruits Ve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GO+3fpJQL._AC_.jpg","description":"YR - Yves Renaud Home Collection brings you this versatile and multi-functional BPA-free with anti-microbial surfaces, food-grade collapsible chopping board - it is a kitchen tool that you never thought you needed until it becomes an indispensable part of your routine! The versatility lies in it being a chopping/cutting and slicing board, which can then be 'un-collapsed' and serve as a vessel to wash your fruits and vegetables. This unit becomes a storage unit when you want it to. There is a drain outlet at the bottom to drain out the water. it is most convenient, easy to use and can be collapsed to be less than 2 inches thick for frustration-free storage! Put it in your cabinet or hang it on the wall - this kitchen tool will serve you in many ways - chopping, cutting, washing, soaking, prep bowl, and is coupled with the ability to fully drain. It is dishwasher safe. This unit holds about 6 quarts. Can be used to wash your veggies, then chop or slice them, or prep your meats for barbecues, or you can throw in some ice and a few beer cans to provide you cold drinks in the backyard or on picnics – a compact design and an effortless to carry ‘makeshift ice-box’ with a drain! It is easy to wash and dishwasher safe. Although not made with the intention, we’ve heard of it being used to soak feet with warm water!We recommend rinsing with hands to remove obvious residue before throwing it into the dishwasher, and recommend it be fully dry before storing. This collapsible chopping board is a must-have for all kitchens – homes, restaurants, RV’s, etc. It is a great item to have when you go camping. Heat resistant to 220 degrees Fahrenheit and it is safe to be kept in refrigerators when you have your meats prepped for barbecue. YR – Yves Renaud offers a growing variety of home and kitchen items, baby items, outdoor and emergency items, and fashion lifestyle jewelry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GO+3fpJQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YR","source_asin":"B08KRHL9F7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KRHL9F7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KRHL9F7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
