window.products.push({"id":265716,"name":"Premium Whiskey Stones (Set of 9). 100% Pure Soapstone - Includes Carrying","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QS1j3VWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fine spirits should be chilled just enough to release the natural flavors and aromas. Whiskey Stones by Zcutt Home Goods are designed to help you enjoy your alcohol, liquor, spirits as they were intended – perfectly cooled beverage to keep the complex flavors at full strength without dilution. ★ Set of 9 whiskey cubed stones and 1 black velvet pouch for easy storage.  ★ Simply wash then place in freezer -- ready to cool your drink in just hours.  ★ Serve 3 to 4 stones to a glass -- pour liquid so that it just covers the top of the stones. ★ Unlike granite and other chilling rocks, the rounded edges of these stones are designed so they won't scratch your drinking glasses. ★ Made from soapstone which is nonporous, odorless and tasteless -- will not add anything extra to your drinks. ★ Safe, natural chilling stone material. BPA Free.  ★ Each whiskey stone is roughly 3/4\" square cube. ★ Great alternative to ice cubes, ice ball maker molds and ice spheres. ★ Whiskey stones make the perfect anniversary gift, birthday gift, Valentine's Day, groomsmen gift, wedding party gift, gift for best man or a great purchase for yourself. Material: 100% Pure Soapstone Size: 3/4 x 3/4 x 3/4 inches - (2 x 2 x 2 cm) Searching for the perfect gift for anyone on your list? This is it! Order now and start enjoying all your spirits at the right temperature and fullest flavor. Copyright Zcutt Home Goods 2017.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QS1j3VWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zcutt Home Goods","source_asin":"B0183CMQQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0183CMQQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0183CMQQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
