window.products.push({"id":265952,"name":"Estmy White Boho Tufted Shower Curtain Extra Long 84 Inch, Pompom Polka Dot Simple Cute Modern Shower Curtain Sets with Hooks Bohemian Chic Bathroom D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617BPrA4F0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Estmy Modern Simple Cute Bathroom Shower Curtains Set Extra Long 84 Inch White Tufted Polka Dots Designs Boho Shabby Chic Bathroom Decor. Is your bathroom all white and gray? Clean and simple? Boring? Luckily, we discovered the most subtle accessory you could possibly purchase. Just look at this unique shower curtain and soak in all of its glory. ★Questions & Answers: 1. Q: Do you need a liner with it?  A:No. This shabby chic bathroom curtains coated resin on both sides, you have no need to use a liner at all. Liners mold easily so you can hang only this hipster shower curtain. Just remember to wash it as soon as you see visible stains on the bottom. 2. Q: what is the material for the simplistic shower curtain set?  A: They are crafted with 160GSM polyester fabric, durable and opaque. 3. Q: Does the bouqutie shower curtain come with the hooks  A: Yes, it comes with 12 stainless steel rust-resistant shower curtain hooks for your convenience. 4. Q: Does this seller offer free returns? What if I don't want it after received it?   A: Yes for sure. We offer 24-hour online customer service, kindly contact with us and we will issue you a refund/return/exchange. 5. Q: Can I iron this cute shower curtain? Can it be washed and or dried without shrinking?  A: Yes! Upon receiving, the lush bath curtain is folded and leaves fold creases, used iron to remove those creases will make it more pretty. And the material is pretty durable, can safely machine wash and tumble dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617BPrA4F0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Estmy","source_asin":"B09PFQ8QCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PFQ8QCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PFQ8QCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265953,"name":"Tree Talker by Pat Saunders-White, 24x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61akDqSBA9L._AC_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an abstract composition. Instantly recognizable, the brilliant, saturated colors of Pat Saunders-White;s animal paintings have established her as a national pet portrait artist. Pat brings an element of spontaneity, boldness and humor into a genre that is often stiff and photo realistic. Pat's big 'Ah-Ha!' moment was when she painted her first animal. Fourteen year later, she still finds this an exciting niche. The first animal paintings in this new style and technique gave her a feeling of 'coming home' after a long journey. Pat participates in juried national shows and presents workshops in her home studio and various workshop venues. She donates her work annually to non-profit fundraisers. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61akDqSBA9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLYD7F4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLYD7F4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLYD7F4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265954,"name":"Keurig Supreme Plus Single Serve Coffee Maker Bundle (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41at1wyejNL._AC_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41at1wyejNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B08QN9V48H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QN9V48H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QN9V48H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265955,"name":"Cackleberry Home Deluxe Merry Christmas Embroidered Red Farm Truck Tree Skirt Quilted Woven Cotton Chambray and Yuletide Plaid, 21 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19QZ-6WunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Festive tan chambray tree skirt with red, green, and white plaid border, edge piping, and ties. Embroidered \"Merry Christmas\" red farm truck and snowflakes. Decorative diagonal stitching lines add an extra touch and help secure the padding. Generous length ties. Two-tone natural and tan chambray woven fabric provides a rustic yet elegant look. Tan chambray fabric on reverse side. Coordinates with both Yuletide Plaid and \"Let It Snow\" products. Plaid repeat measures 3 by 3 inches. Sturdy 100% cotton with soft polyester padding. Spot clean. Made in India. This beautiful and iconic embroidered red farm truck design adds a touch of class to your Christmas home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19QZ-6WunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cackleberry Home","source_asin":"B0B7D6B334","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7D6B334","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7D6B334","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":265956,"name":"Modway Lippa 28\" Marble Dining Table in White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UVy3SSKRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reflecting a seamless organic shape and timeless form, the Lippa Table has become a symbol of modernism for over the past 60 years. Before its release, homes were filled with clunky remnants of an industrial age long gone by. But in order to advance into the new world, homes first had to transition from the traditional square table, into a piece that connoted progress. The base and dimensions are true to the original specifications, while the table’s square top, and tapered base, are carefully lacquered with a scratch and chip resistant finish. Set Includes: One - Lippa 28\" Side Table Product Dimensions: Overall Product Dimensions: 27.5\"L x 27.5\"W x 29.5\"H Floor to Underside of Table: 27.5\"H Thickness of Table Top: .75\"H Base Width: 20\"W Width of Legs: 14\"W","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UVy3SSKRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modway","source_asin":"B00UVO2BAW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UVO2BAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UVO2BAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
