window.products.push({"id":265961,"name":"Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts Personalized Cutting Board - Laser Engraved Wooden Chopping Boards, Custom Charcuterie Board, Personalized Gift for Newlywed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715qzZVNGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED LASER ENGRAVED BOARD: Choose from various styles and options for your own cutting board, making it as unique as you are. Maple, Cherry, and Walnut are all available woods for our cutting boards. We have a small, medium, and large chopping block, with juice grooves and handles cut into the side. We can include a gift box, a display stand, or a large bottle of our own cutting board oil to an make exclusive Christmas ornament or gift for your loved ones. 3 TYPES OF WOOD: Our cutting boards are crafted from top materials, such as Walnut, which is very sought after for its texture and grain. Our second most popular wood is Cherry, which is somewhat darker in color and has a subtle orange to red hue. Our third most popular is Maple, which is the lightest of the three species and blends well in light-colored kitchens. Our wood cutting boards are crafted from the finest materials for long-term use. 3 DIFFERENT SIZES: These cutting boards can be used in kitchens to outdoor picnics. Our largest and most popular cutting board is 18\" x 12\" x 1.25\"(Large). It can be used as a charcuterie board and has juice grooves and handles. The 16\" x 10\" x.75\"(Medium) is our regular cutting board with curved edges and juice grooves. Our 12\" x 9\" x.75\"(Small) chopping board can be used for cabins, yachts, and apartments. All sizes are craftily engraved cutting boards that have precise, durable edges. EXCELLENT GIFT: Our personalized cutting boards are must-haves for your home, and any food enthusiast will love having them around to prep fruits, veggies, and more! With the attractive laser engraving, it's a superb Christmas gift. Fitting for dad and mom's birthday, wedding gifts, anniversary gifts, housewarming gifts, couple gifts, Christmas home decor and more. ABOUT US: Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts is a growing company specializing in personalized gifts and home decor products. We offer high-quality products like this customized cutting board at a competitive price with the best possible customer experience. Our cutting boards are made in the USA, manufactured and engraved locally in Virginia.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715qzZVNGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts","source_asin":"B0BXVDW3ZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-265961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXVDW3ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXVDW3ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
